   ],
   "html": "<p>For the launch of <em>Margo’s Got Money Troubles</em>, Apple TV partnered with I to create<!-- --> a social-first, immersive creator showcase that brought together real-life “Margos” and invited guests into a bold, genre-blurring world where wrestling met ASMR, foot content turned cinematic, and makeup became live performance art, celebrating creativity, hustle, and self-made success on one’s own terms.</p>\n<p>We brought together some of the internet's most inventive voices: <strong>Thunder Rosa, Taylor Darling, Snitchery, Cindy Chen, Molly Balloons, Parker Day, and Bridget McCarty Minis</strong> - and created experiences around them while prioritizing partnerships with women-aligned creators to provide a cultural co-sign that resonates with the target female demographic while celebrating the bold, heartfelt, and unconventional spirit of the show.</p>"
  }
 ],
 "sections": [
  {
   "title": "party vibes & decor",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "html": "<p>The ambiance was set from the start with an opening set by<strong> </strong><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/arthi.nachiappan/\"><strong>DJ ARTHI</strong></a>, while <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/chloecaillet/\"><strong>DJ Chloé Caillet</strong></a><strong> </strong>carried the energy through the after party. For entertainment, attendees were immersed in the imaginative world of <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/mollyballoons/\"><strong>Molly Balloons</strong>,</a> whose custom-designed lewks transformed the space. <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/lindsey.bug/?hl=en\"><strong>Lindsey Normington</strong></a> and <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/riconasty/?hl=en\"><strong>Rico Nasty</strong></a>, stars from the show, joined us for the evening. Guests indulged in nostalgic comfort classics from<strong> </strong><a href=\"https://www.babysbadassburgers.com/\"><strong>Baby’s Burgers</strong></a>, alongside curated specialty cocktails, followed by ice cream from <a href=\"https://www.creamyboys.com/experiential-marketing?utm_gclid=CjwKCAjwxeHWBhBPEiwAiqtQ-WiDaFvmC2eB7kpnX-29lQxwrOcLdBfvmr8bpFelEt6Nk9Pfk7dCahoCELoQAvD_BwE&amp;utm_source=google&amp;utm_medium=search&amp;utm_campaign=experiential&amp;utm_assetgroup=6624748745&amp;utm_term=&amp;utm_device=c&amp;gad_source=1&amp;gad_campaignid=23193266058&amp;gbraid=0AAAABA78YNQa4yZc6Ec-5sGqEnL807lqb&amp;gclid=CjwKCAjwxeHWBhBPEiwAiqtQ-WiDaFvmC2eB7kpnX-29lQxwrOcLdBfvmr8bpFelEt6Nk9Pfk7dCahoCELoQAvD_BwE\"><strong>Creamy Bros</strong></a><strong>. </strong> </p>"
