   "title": "TRANSFORMATION STATION",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text2",
     "left": "<p><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/DXfK5h0ku1A/\"><strong>Snitchery </strong></a>arrived in a Margo-inspired look and sat for a full, high-impact HungryGhost makeup transformation with <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/DXh4VpbkuLf/?img_index=1\"><strong>Cindy Chen</strong></a> at center stage: unhurried, intentional, and impossible to look away from.</p>",
     "right": "<p>Guests styled themselves at vanity stations stocked with accessories while watching the craft unfold in real time. By the end of the night, the booth opened up entirely for guests to take over.</p>"
    },
