  {
   "title": "TUNNEL OF LOVE",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "html": "<p>With objects like a larger than life cockroach, plushy aliens, and other embellishments, each guest stepped into the Tunnel of Love set for a one-of-a-kind portraits with <a href=\"https://www.parkerdayphotography.com/\"><strong>Parker Day.</strong></a> The result? A photo that actually looked like art, not a photo booth print.</p>"
