  {
   "title": "foot pic diorama",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text2",
     "left": "<p>We tapped miniature set builder <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/bridgetmccartyminis/\"><strong>Bridget McCarty</strong></a> to handcraft an intricate diorama built specifically to show off your feet with a hyper-detailed movie theater scene straight out of the show's opening credits.</p>",
     "right": "<p>Guests could remove their shoes, got pampered by our on-site Foot Fluffer (yes, really), stepped into the miniature cityscape, and walked away with a photo that literally no one else has.</p>"
    },
