   "title": "wrestle mania ring",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "html": "<p>Former AEW Women’s World Champion <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/thunderrosa22/\"><strong>Thunder Rosa</strong></a> brought a full spectacle to our dedicated outdoor wrestling ring, coaching guests through power moves and dramatic poses built for the camera. A steadicam operator captured the interaction and every guest walked out with a clip that made them look like they could headline WrestleMania.</p>"
